                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "sans-serif"}
                      %mi C
                    %mi U
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathsf{C}U
              regarded as a locale in its own right. Equivalently, this means the equalizer of the two maps
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
